  "result": "I've fixed all three digest problems. The type-check passes, but I didn't run the test suite.\n\n1. **Opt-in:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now returns only people with at least one `digestOnly = true` preference in the workspace. Before, it returned anyone with any preference row.\n2. **Newest first:** `listUnreadSince` in `src/server/repositories/notification-repository.ts` now orders by `createdAt` descending. The cap of `DIGEST_MAX_ENTRIES` in `buildDigest` therefore keeps the most recent updates, and the email headline (the first entry) is the newest one.\n3. **Archived workspaces:** `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` skips any workspace with `archivedAt` set. `buildDigest` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` also returns `null` for one, so it sends nothing even if called directly. Live workspaces are unchanged.\n\nI didn't check whether anything else calls `listUnreadSince` and relies on the old oldest-first order.",
